            "id": "claim_276927b28f0c4c458089195971689e2d",
            "statement": "`SoundRegistry` keeps URL-only sound descriptors in a private `Map<SoundId, SoundDescriptor>`, exposes the same map through `registry`, and `get()` throws `Sound \"<id>\" not registered` when an ID has no entry.",
