        {
            "id": "claim_e2756bdcbf9f44b8afa3c75ddfb29730",
            "statement": "`IAudioEngineConfig` is the aggregate authored configuration: manifest, buses, snapshots, sound map, events, and banks are required, while RTPCs, music FSM, voice and RAM limits, precalculated sizes, sequencer settings, seed, and remote telemetry URI are optional.",
