        {
            "id": "claim_4a6f0a2d49eb4b9693172d0b8f10a762",
            "statement": "Bank loading joins a bank's listed sound IDs to the sprite manifest to create buffer requests with manifest priority and estimated size; unknown manifest IDs are skipped, and a bank with no loadable entries immediately becomes `LOADED`. Unload stops the bank's sounds without tails, purges their pooled instances and cached URLs, then records `UNLOADED`.",
            "evidence": [
                {
                    "resource": "repo://packages/engine/src/Infrastructure/loader/BankManagerAdapter.ts",
                    "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:bcea726b46dfbf1f013363950878bc195adbd4ea98f017d76fd35a7ce88d3178"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "claim_5fd440ea83a748deab6430e125c9f66f",
            "statement": "`AudioEngine.streams.load(soundId)` fetches JSON from the first URL of that sound's sprite-manifest entry and caches the resulting `IStreamManifest` by URL; it rejects an unknown ID or failed response, while `unload()` evicts the cache entry and ignores an unknown ID. `SoundController` uses the cached manifest in preference to a decoded buffer when playing that descriptor.",
            "evidence": [
                {
                    "resource": "repo://packages/engine/src/Application/AudioEngine.ts",
                    "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:9f10fd4bb6d3a515d4a4850f149c1808b0dd21cd0efeb1e220f8f6e0ede316c7"
                },
                {
                    "resource": "repo://packages/engine/src/Infrastructure/loader/SoundController.ts",
                    "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:0c9fe2508e6e181dcb31d4cde47de73082c06275500f0b4114518948b17926f6"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "claim_f6675ac600464d49b0d29bc2996c63b4",
            "statement": "Validation runs against the aggregate configuration before runtime composition completes. In strict mode an invalid result emits `engine:error` with `INIT_FAILED` and returns; in non-strict mode initialization warns and proceeds.",
            "evidence": [
